edAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Absolutely. Walmart is a core platform for us. We support Walmart seller center sync, inventory management, order syncing, and repricing. Many of our sellers do 50/50 Amazon-Walmart splits."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What does Ecom Circles cost?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Plans start at $27/month and scale with your volume. You get access to the entire suite: scanning, repricing, inventory management, order management, and our Chrome extension. No per-feature charges."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there a free trial?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. 14 days free. Credit card required (not charged during trial). Cancel anytime, no questions asked."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How is Ecom Circles different from a single platform like Sellify?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Sellify is research-only ($19.99/mo). Ecom Circles covers research, repricing, inventory sync, order management, and fulfillment coordination. You're buying a complete operations platform, not just a scanner."}}]}</script><div class="pgx-733"><section class="pgx-33 pgi-196 bg-shades"><div class="pgx-34"><div class="pgx-35"><h1 class="pgx-36 font-satoshi">Ecom Circles vs the Competition: Honest Comparisons</h1><p class="pgx-734">We compare ourselves to seven of the leading Amazon and Walmart seller tools. See how Ecom Circles stacks up on features, pricing, support, and marketplace coverage.</p></div></div></section><section class="pgx-735 bg-shades"><div class="pgx-736"><div><h2 class="pgx-737">How does Ecom Circles compare to other tools?</h2><p class="pgx-738">Ecom Circles is built for multi-channel sellers who need one unified platform instead of juggling 5-12 separate tools. Unlike single-purpose tools (research-only scanners, repricing-only platforms, or inventory trackers), Ecom Circles covers the entire seller workflow: product research and scanning, repricing and price monitoring, inventory synchronization across marketplaces, order management and fulfillment, and a powerful browser extension for quick lookups.</p><p class="pgx-738">Most competitors focus on one marketplace or one function. Ecom Circles covers scanning, repricing, inventory management, order management, and a Chrome extension, across Amazon, Walmart, and Mirakl. This comprehensive approach means you pay less per feature and spend less time context-switching between tools. Instead of toggling between a scanner app, a repricing dashboard, an inventory spreadsheet, and a fulfillment tracker, everything you need is in one place with a consistent interface.</p><p class="pgx-738">The real advantage emerges as your operation grows. A 10-SKU store might get away with a basic scanner. But a 500-SKU seller across Amazon and Walmart needs automated repricing, inventory sync across channels, order management, and fulfillment coordination, or they spend hours every week manually managing prices, syncing stock levels, and chasing orders. Single-purpose tools force you to build this workflow yourself. Ecom Circles comes with it built in.</p><p class="pgx-43">By choosing an all-in-one platform, you&#x27;re not just saving money on subscriptions. You&#x27;re reclaiming the time your team spends switching tools and copy-pasting data. You&#x27;re reducing the chance of human error when syncing inventory manually. And you&#x27;re building on a foundation designed by people who understand multi-channel ecommerce operations because we&#x27;ve run them ourselves.</p></div></div></section><section class="pgx-490 bg-shades"><div class="pgx-739"><div class="pgx-50"><h2 class="pgx-740 font-satoshi">Explore Each Comparison</h2><p class="pgx-741">Click any card below to see a detailed side-by-side breakdown.</p></div><div class="pgx-225"><a href="scanunlimited.php"><div class="pgx-742 pgx-770"><h3 class="pgx-743 font-satoshi">ScanUnlimited</h3><p class="pgx-479">Amazon-focused scanning tool</p><div class="pgx-744 pgi-197">View Comparison<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="pgx-80 lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></div></div></a><a href="flipmine.php"><div class="pgx-742 pgx-770"><h3 class="pgx-743 font-satoshi">Flipmine</h3><p class="pgx-479">Retail/online arbitrage tool</p><div class="pgx-744 pgi-197">View Comparison<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="pgx-80 lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></div></div></a><a href="sellify.php"><div class="pgx-742 pgx-770"><h3 class="pgx-743 font-satoshi">Sellify</h3><p class="pgx-479">Amazon product research tool ($19.99/mo)</p><div class="pgx-744 pgi-197">View Comparison<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="pgx-80 lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></div></div></a><a href="bizmetrica.php"><div class="pgx-742 pgx-770"><h3 class="pgx-743 font-satoshi">Bizmetrica (WAMP)</h3><p class="pgx-479">Walmart analytics by SellerAmp (free beta)</p><div class="pgx-744 pgi-197">View Comparison<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="pgx-80 lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></div></div></a><a href="sourcedart.php"><div class="pgx-742 pgx-770"><h3 class="pgx-743 font-satoshi">SourceDart</h3><p class="pgx-479">Multi-retailer sourcing tool ($29.95/mo)</p><div class="pgx-744 pgi-197">View Comparison<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" 
        stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="pgx-80 lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></div></div></a><a href="getmarter.php"><div class="pgx-742 pgx-770"><h3 class="pgx-743 font-satoshi">Marter</h3><p class="pgx-479">Walmart analytics tool ($24/mo)</p><div class="pgx-744 pgi-197">View Comparison<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="pgx-80 lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></div></div></a><a href="pricelink.php"><div class="pgx-742 pgx-770"><h3 class="pgx-743 font-satoshi">PriceLink</h3><p class="pgx-479">Walmart repricing tool ($30-$99/mo)</p><div class="pgx-744 pgi-197">View Comparison<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="pgx-80 lucide lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></div></div></a></div></div></section><section class="pgx-745 bg-shades"><div class="pgx-739"><div class="pgx-50"><h2 class="pgx-51 font-satoshi">What Ecom Circles Covers</h2><p class="pgx-741">Every major area of multi-channel selling operations, all in one platform.</p></div><div class="pgx-463"><div><h3 class="pgx-743 font-satoshi">Scanner</h3><p class="pgx-296">Upload wholesale supplier lists in any CSV or XLSX format. No reformatting required. AI-enhanced matching catches pack count issues and variation mismatches that basic UPC matching misses. Check restrictions on both Amazon and Walmart before you buy. Unlimited list scanning on Growth and Scale plans.</p><a class="pgx-314 pgi-197" href="scanner.php">Learn about Scanner →</a></div><div><h3 class="pgx-743 font-satoshi">Repricer</h3><p class="pgx-296">Reprice across Amazon and Walmart from one dashboard. Set your minimum margin. Repricing never goes below it. Choose which types of competitors to target. One live strategy (Get the Buy Box) with three more coming soon: Competitive, Profit Target, and Velocity. Included on every plan.</p><a class="pgx-314 pgi-197" href="repricer.php">Learn about Repricer →</a></div><div><h3 class="pgx-743 font-satoshi">Inventory Management</h3><p class="pgx-296">Track inventory across Amazon, Walmart, and Mirakl in one dashboard. COGS tracking with margin calculations. Bulk edit hundreds of SKUs at once via CSV upload. Low stock alerts keep you ahead of stockouts. Restock forecasting powered by sales velocity data. Changes sync automatically across all channels.</p><a class="pgx-314 pgi-197" href="inventory-management.php">Learn about Inventory →</a></div><div><h3 class="pgx-743 font-satoshi">Order Management</h3><p class="pgx-296">See all orders from all channels in one dashboard. Track status from marketplace to customer doorstep. Flag issues early, coordinate fulfillment, and manage returns. Unified order flow prevents the chaos of juggling multiple seller dashboards.</p><a class="pgx-314 pgi-197" href="order-management.php">Learn about Orders →</a></div><div><h3 class="pgx-743 font-satoshi">Chrome Extension</h3><p class="pgx-296">Seven tools in one extension built specifically for Walmart sellers. Walmart price history (like Keepa, but for Walmart), estimated sales, UPC lookup, IP complaint checking, auto-ungate for Amazon categories, bulk listing deletion, and WFS fee estimation. Included with every Ecom Circles plan.</p><a class="pgx-314 pgi-197" href="extension.php">Learn about Extension →</a></div><div><h3 class="pgx-743 font-satoshi">Warehouse Services</h3><p class="pgx-296">FBA prep and WFS prep at $1/unit. Two warehouses near Chicago and Atlanta. 3PL integration built into the software: POs, inventory check-in, fulfillment, and buy shipping all through Ecom Circles. Returns processing, two-step dropshipping, and secure storage included for active customers.</p><a class="pgx-314 pgi-197" href="warehouse.php">Learn about Warehouse →</a></div></div></div></section><section class="pgx-746 bg-shades"><div class="pgx-736"><div><h2 class="pgx-747 font-satoshi">Why Compare? The All-in-One Advantage</h2><div class="pgx-24"><div><h3 class="pgx-748">Single-Purpose vs. Unified Platform</h3><p class="pgx-738">Most competitors solve one problem. <a class="pgx-749 pgi-18 pg-link-onDark" href="blog/scan-unlimited-review/index.html">Scan Unlimited</a> finds deals. Flipmine syncs inventory. Sellify researches products. Marter and PriceLink reprices on Walmart. Bizmetrica shows analytics. You end up with seven tabs open, seven logins to remember, and seven invoices every month.</p><p class="pgx-43">Ecom Circles does all of it. One login. One dashboard. One bill. You find a deal with our scanner, repricing adjusts it automatically, inventory syncs across channels, orders flow in unified, and fulfillment scales with your warehouse. No context-switching. No fragmentation.</p></div><div><h3 class="pgx-748">Real Support from Real Sellers</h3><p class="pgx-43">Ecom Circles was built by sellers, for sellers. Our support team understands seller operations because we&#x27;ve been there. We ship new features monthly based on seller feedback. We care about your success because we know the business.</p></div><div><h3 class="pgx-748">Multi-Marketplace Coverage</h3><p class="pgx-43">Amazon and Walmart are the priority for most sellers. Ecom Circles supports both natively, with Mirakl support and more marketplaces on the roadmap. Many single-purpose tools lock you into one platform. We grow with you.</p></div><div><h3 class="pgx-748">Total Cost of Ownership</h3><p class="pgx-43">Running separate tools for scanning, repricing, inventory sync, and order management adds up fast, and that&#x27;s before you factor in the time spent switching between dashboards. Ecom Circles starts at $27/month and covers the entire workflow in one platform.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="pgx-745 bg-shades"><div class="pgx-739"><div class="pgx-81"><div class="pgx-46"><div class="pgx-750 pgi-198">$1.7B+</div><p class="pgx-751">In sales volume processed</p></div><div class="pgx-46"><div class="pgx-750 pgi-198">7,174+</div><p class="pgx-751">Sellers on Ecom Circles</p></div><div class="pgx-46"><div class="pgx-750 pgi-198">Every month</div><p class="pgx-751">New features shipped</p></div></div></div></section><?php
